\par\par \b \uc2  HK Hibor Down Late On HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 11:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  interbank rates are lower late Wednesday, after the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold U.S. dollars one day earlier and offered three-month money early in the current session. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 7.00%, down from 8.00% late Tuesday. The three-month rate is 11.5%, down from 12.25%. \par \par \uc2  The HKMA confirmed Wednesday that it bought Hong Kong dollars and sold U.S. dollars, which took pressure off local interest rates, along with news that the HKMA was lending three-month money early in the session. \par \par \uc2  A treasurer with a local bank added, however, that the market remains very thin. Dealers said the recent volatility in interbank rates and the stock market are deterring both borrowers and lenders. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with an Australian bank said he heard there's been some selling in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since lunch, taking the heat off the local unit and also off local interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The a local bank treasurer said he doesn't expect to see another bout of Hong Kong dollar selling in European and U.S. trading later Wednesday. The pressure on the Hong Kong dollar will continue to ease," he said. \par \par \uc2  In the futures market, the three-month September Hibor contract is quoted at 88.75 for an underlying money market yield of 11.25%. It has moved between 87.85 at a rate of 12.15% and 88.75 at a yield of 11.25% on volume of 2,695 lots. \par \par \uc2  Late Wednesday, the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7483 per U.S. dollar, stronger than the HK$7.7490 the previous day. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 12-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0927GMT \par \par \uc2  1085 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8c06use\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
