\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Stronger Late On Firm Yen, HKMA Activity \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 10:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar strengthened modestly late Wednesday, as the yen fought back from eight-year lows and speculators ceded ground to the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Speculators backed out of the market Wednesday, traders said, after making a move on the Hong Kong dollar the day before. Speculators have been - at least temporarily - scared off by \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday and by indications the HKMA lent HK$200 million in the three-month money market early Wednesday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The HKMA wouldn't comment on trader reports of its activity Wednesday, but did confirm it had sold U.S. dollars for Hong Kong dollars Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0830 GMT (4:30 a.m. EDT), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7483 against the U.S. dollar, stronger than the HK$7.7490 quoted late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has traded in a range of HK$7.7475 and HK$7.7495 so far Wednesday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The yen stood at Y146.01 to the U.S. dollar, compared with Y147.50 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  With the yen stronger and the HKMA in the market, interbank lending rates eased and forward premiums have fallen Wednesday. The volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 7.00%, compared with 8.00% late during the previous session. The benchmark three-month rate is 11.5% from 12.25% late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Telerate page [1085]. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 12-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0848GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8c06ul7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
