\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Flat Early In London;Speculators Still In Forward Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1998\par 11:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Speculators continued to build up short forward positions and rattle confidence in the Hong Kong dollar Friday, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is holding steady near a key support level in spot transactions. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar is trading at HK$7.7499 at the start of the London trading day, nearly steady from the HK$7.7501 rate quoted in London late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  But the Hong Kong dollar's steadiness - which is the point of the city's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board - masks an extremely active session in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets. Forward premiums surged to their highest levels since the start of the year Thursday, as hedge funds were joined by retail investors in selling the Hong Kong dollar short in the forward markets. Banks tightened lending, unwilling to part with liquidity they might need. One dealer said it was possible that banks were lending to speculators looking to secure cover, but were charging an extremely high interest rate. \par \par \uc2  Late in the Asian day, premiums slipped a touch, however, as some investors ducked out of the market ahead of the weekend, possibly fearing volatile trading or market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  in London or New York, said a dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  The six-month premium is steady at 2650 points from late Thursday. The one-year premium is 5600 points over the spot rate, up from 5100 points. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 07-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0939GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8706pz3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
