\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Firmer Late, Helped By Liquidity Squeeze \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 1998\par 10:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar was fractionally stronger late Tuesday in thin trade, shrugging off renewed weakness in the Japanese yen, and was helped by a pending liquidity squeeze. \par \par \uc2  Around 0720 GMT (3:20 a.m. EDT), the Hong Kong dollar was quoted at HK$7.7483 against the U.S. dollar, compared with HK$7.7487 late Tuesday. The local unit has traded between HK$7.7479 and HK$7.7485 so far Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The aggregate balance, the accounts banks keep with the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to clear \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions, is due to fall HK$465 million to HK$1.88 billion later Tuesday. As a result of the fall in liquidity, pressure will remain on interbank rates, supporting the Hong Kong dollar in the process. \par \par \uc2  Forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums are also down, reflecting some unwinding of position. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the three-month premium is quoted at 740 points, compared with 830 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 1,730 points, down from 1,900. The one-year premium is quoted at 3,850 points, down from 3,925 previously. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said banks expect to see the yen sold further to test where the Bank of Japan will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is being pushed between HK$7.75 per U.S. dollar, which attracts HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but selling U.S. dollars for \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars when the local unit is about HK$7.7450. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 6.5%, compared with 5.5% late during the previous session. The three-month rate is 9.25% from 9.75% late Monday. For more Hibor news, please refer to Telerate page [1085]. \par \par \uc2  -By Sean Kennedy; (852) 2802 7002; skennedy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0840GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8406m50\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
