\par\par \b \uc2  US/HK forwards hold firm by midday. \b0\par\par\uc2 511 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juli 1998\par 07:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab  Midday\tab     Open\tab    Previous Close\par HK$ SPOT     7.7487/97\tab  7.7490/00\tab  7.7485/95\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORWARDS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 3-Month\tab 600-650\tab    600-650\tab    500-530\par 6-Month\tab 1,600-1,700     1,625-1,725     1,425-1,525\par 1-Year\tab  3,800-4,100     3,700-3,900     3,600-3,800\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INTERBANK RATE (IN PERCENTAGE)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Overnight    5.25-6.25\tab  5.00-6.12\tab  5.25-5.75\par 3-Month\tab 8.50-9.00\tab  8.50-9.00\tab  7.69-8.06\par 6-Month\tab 9.62-10.00\tab 9.50-10.25\tab 8.88-9.25\par 1-Year\tab  10.50-11.00     10.50-11.00     10.12-10.50.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, July 10 (Reuters) - Limited follow-through buying\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par halted further gains in US/HK forwards by Friday's midday,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Forwards and interbank rates jumped in early trade in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par response to a rising dollar/yen as well as because of an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par increase in net sales of Hong Kong dollars in the banking\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par system, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But gains were stemmed as dollar/yen steadied in a tight\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par range and worries over Hong Kong dollar balances subsided in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par absence of further indications of a movement in the net sales\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par balance against the Hong Kong dollar, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The forecast change in aggregate balance attributable to\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transactions for Monday settlement remained at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par negative HK$775 million at 0400 GMT, unchanged from 0130 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The net change balance had remained at zero over the past\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par few weeks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     An HKMA spokeswoman declined to comment on the change in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par balances. Dealers said it was unclear whether the sales were for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par commercial or speculative purposes, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Some said the change in balance might be attributable to one\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par single transaction, as the size was only about US$100 million.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     They said the transaction could have been recorded during\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par London trading hours when the Hong Kong dollar spot hit HK$7.75\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Some suspected the fall in balances was due to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Last night in London and New York time, I believe the HKMA\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, so today the aggregate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par balance has shown a withdrawal of about 100 million U.S. dollars\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par equivalent," Andrew Fung, treasurer at Commonwealth Bank of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Australia, told Reuters Television on Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "This means that on Monday the aggregate balance of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par banking system has about HK$775 million less, so interest rates,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par especially in the short end, are expected to increase. Today the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par short end has increased by one percent already." he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said if the HKMA had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  buying the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar on Thursday at HK$7.75, it would not rush to sell it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par until it gets around HK$7.7430/40 per U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dollar/yen rose to 141.46 but remained heavy due to Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par exporter offers and caution before Sunday's Japanese Upper House\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par election.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -Angi Li (852) 2847 4039; Fax (852) 2845 0636.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du7a01acy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
