\par\par \b \uc2  US/HK forwards end mixed despite weaker yen at 138. \b0\par\par\uc2 591 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 1998\par 10:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab   Close\tab \tab    Open\tab    Previous Close\par HK$ SPOT\tab 7.7405/30\tab      7.7410/20    7.7405/30\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORWARDS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   3-Month     600-700\tab \tab  670-720\tab 650-750\par 6-Month     1,550-1,700\tab    1,500-1,800  1,525-1,725\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INTERBANK RATE (IN PERCENT)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Overnight   6.00-7.00\tab      6.75-7.75    7.0-8.0\par 3-Month     8.25-9.25\tab      8.37-9.50    8.37-9.37\par 6-Month     9.25-10.25\tab     9.25-10.25   9.12-10.12.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, June 22 (Reuters) - US/HK forwards ended mixed on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday with bid tones stronger at the longer end as the Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yen dipped to 138 per U.S. dollar in late trade, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Buying interest for forwards was focused on maturities over\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par six months, pushing the six-month higher than at opening levels\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par but steady when compared with Friday's close, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Shorter-dated forwards eased as short term rates softened,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par partly because of the large amount of one-week money offers by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "I heard the HKMA offered one-week money at 7.75 percent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par today," a senior dealer said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said while short term rates remained volatile,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par longer-dated rates were well-supported at current levels as the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par risk premium of the Hong Kong dollar over the U.S. dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par remained high in the wake of poor regional and Japanese economic\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par outlook.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The U.S.-Japan joint \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to rescue the yen last\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par week sent only brief relief to regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unlikely to have much effect over the long run, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Since the U.S.-Japan joint \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last Wednesday,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par demand for the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar has risen sharply, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The HKMA's page on the Reuters screen\tab \tab  showed that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the aggregate balance of net Hong Kong dollar sales for U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollars has declined dramatically over the past week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "That means there is an inflow of funds," an HKMA spokesman\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said, adding that there is increased demand for the Hong Kong\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar against the U.S. dollar in the local banking system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The forecast change in aggregate balance attributable to\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transaction for Tuesday settlement was a positive HK$875\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million. This compared with a negative HK$7.26 billion quoted in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par early trade last Monday for settlement for the next day (June\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 16).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The authority's page also showed that the forecast aggregate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par balance before the liquidity adjustment facility (LAF), or\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par discount window, was quoted at HK$2.59 billion, and HK$3.465\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par billion for Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A rise in aggregate balance before LAF indicates higher\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par interbank liqudity, a spokeswoman at the HKMA said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Starting June 12, the HKMA added to its Reuters page a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par forecast of changes in the aggregate balance of banks' clearing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par accounts with the HKMA attributable to the HKMA's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transactions.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Asked if the HKMA was giving speculators ammunition to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par attack the Hong Kong dollar by disclosing this information, Yam\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was quoted by the Hong Kong Standard as saying:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "No, one thing I am quite sure of -- had we not disclosed\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the information, the selling pressure (on the Hong Kong dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on 12 June) would have intensified over the weekend and extended\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to Monday and Tuesday."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Yam said local interest rates were likely to remain high\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par until confidence returned to the banking systems of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par territory and the region, the newspaper said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     --Angi Li Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6m02ewy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
