\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Early Nears Key Level, Eroded By Japanese Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 1998\par 04:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar weakened and forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums rose after the Japanese yen resumed its slide, triggering fears of another round of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluations. \par \par \uc2  Around 0225 GMT (10:25 p.m. Thursday EDT), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7497 against the U.S. dollar, weaker than HK$7.7475 late Thursday. The Hong Kong dollar has traded in a range of HK$7.7484 and HK$7.7495. \par \par \uc2  That's dangerously close to the sensitive HK$7.7500 level, which is believed to trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums also rose, in all but the one-month maturities. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month is quoted at 500 points, unchanged from late in the previous session. The three-month premium is quoted at 1400 points, compared with 1200 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 2500 points, up from 2350 previously. The one-year premium is quoted at 5000 points, up from 4600 previously. \par \par \uc2  The yen's weakness early Friday is blamed on U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin, who overnight said U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is only a temporary solution. \par \par \uc2  A local bank dealer said the local unit was quoted at HK$7.7510 but there were no trades. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 7.00%, from 6.00% late Thursday. The three-month rate is 11.5%, up from 11.0% late Thursday. For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones [page 1085]. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0249GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6c051pf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
