sian fund managers by Merrill Lynch indicates that one-third of the managers who responded expect the Hong Kong's U.S. dollar peg to fall later this year or next year. \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG STANDARD - Turnover on the Hong Kong stock market has been falling steadily since February as the economy continues to contract. \par \par \uc2  - Swire Pacific is being tipped as the latest major corporate likely to tap Hong Kong's syndicated loan market. \par \par \uc2  WEN WEI PO - Launch date of the new Hong Kong Futures Exchange will be confirmed next month. \par \par \uc2  - Henderson Land and Sun Hung Kai are the only developers to bid for building a shopping centre in the Chek Lap Kok airport south commercial zone. \par \par \uc2  - Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441; Fax 2845 0636. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6903g8e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
