\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Strengthens Early On Surge In Forward  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Premiums \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 1998\par 05:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar strengthened early Monday after a weak yen pushed up interbank rates in defense of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums surged. \par \par \uc2  Around 0220 GMT (10:20 p.m. Sunday EDT), the Hong Kong dollar was quoted at HK$7.7485 against the U.S. dollar, down from HK$7.7497 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  A local bank dealer said an unnamed institution bought Hong Kong dollars at HK$7.75 Friday offshore after the local market closed. That level is believed to be the trigger for \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums rose after the yen pushed through 140 yen against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month is quoted at 220 points from 170 late in the previous session. The three-month premium is quoted at 700 points, compared with 620 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 1,650 points, up from 1,450 previously. \par \par \uc2  The one-year premium is quoted at 3,800 points, up from 3,400 previously. In the same month last year, the one-year premium averaged 321 points, but it's still well below its peak at an average 6,014 points in January. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said some hedge funds are believed to be making money in the forwards, having bought in recent weeks when premiums fell. "They buy them when they're cheap and then scare people into buying them when they go up," said a treasurer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness has pushed the three-month Hong Kong interbank rate sharply higher early Monday, hitting 9.25%, from 8.625% Friday. For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones page [1085]. \par \par \uc2  -By Sean Kennedy; (852) 2802 7002; skennedy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0306GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6804wao\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
