\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Early Strengthens After Interest Rates Spike \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juni 1998\par 05:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar strengthened early Tuesday boosted by a rise in interbank rates after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flirted with a key support level. \par \par \uc2  Around 0245 GMT (10:45 p.m. Monday EDT), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7485 against the U.S. dollar, up from HK$7.7490 late Monday. The Hong Kong dollar has traded between HK$7.7490 and HK$7.7492 so far Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dissatisfaction with a government stimulus package unveiled last week is eroding the Hong Kong stock market, and spilling over into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the spot Hong Kong dollar was traded overnight at HK$7.7498 in both New York and London. That's perilously close to the HK$7.75 level that's believed to trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  They said a 3.6% decline in the stock market Monday prompted banks to sit on their cash, squeezing liquidity, while buying in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is also putting upward pressure on money market rates. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month premium is quoted at 220 points from 190 late in the previous session. The three-month premium is quoted at 670 points, compared with 620 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 1500 points, up from 1420 previously. The one-year premium is quoted at 3600 points, up from 3400 previously. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 6.25%, up from 5.5% late Tuesday. The three-month rate is 9.0%, up from 8.25% late Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones\par page [1085].\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - By Sean Kennedy; (852) 2802 7002; skennedy@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0334GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6204osj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
