\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2 /HK Dlr -2: Large Drain From Discount Window \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 April 1998\par 13:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  moved within minutes of the home \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market close Wednesday, selling U.S. dollars in London to take the Hong Kong dollar to sharply stronger levels. \par \par \uc2  The head of treasury at a Hong Kong bank said his dealers saw a large bank in London selling U.S. dollars from the HK$7.7480 per U.S. dollar level all the way down to HK$7.7447, shortly after the HKMA announced that there had been a significant outflow of funds from the Hong Kong banking system over the past day. He said the size of the transactions and their pattern smacked of HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The HKMA didn't respond to phone calls seeking comment late Wednesday in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  The treasury chief, who declined to be named, said the dollar selling was done in conjunction with an engineered withdrawal from the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight discount window to counter a glut of Hong Kong dollars that could have caused the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken sharply overnight in the London and New York centers. \par \par \uc2  The net withdrawal of HK$7.67 billion from the overnight window, called the Liquidity Adjustment Facility, forced the overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate to spike to 6.5%, compared with 4.25% late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'It's very obvious the government is doing something in the market,' the treasury chief said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 29-04-98 \par \par \uc2  1138GMT \par \par \uc2  (Corrected at 1230GMT) \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4t03l58\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
