\par\par \b \uc2  HK Early Hibor Quiet, Attention On Hong Kong Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 April 1998\par 06:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Hong Kong interbank rates rose marginally in lackluster trade early Monday, but attention is focused on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, where the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is hovering close to a key \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  point. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 4.125% by Commonwealth Bank of Australia, up from 4.0625% late Friday. The three-month rate is 6.125%, up from 6.10268% late Friday \par \par \uc2  'It's pretty quiet. We don't see much happening. We're looking at the spot Hong Kong dollar to see if it comes under pressure,' said a dealer with an Asian institution. \par \par \uc2  If the Hong Kong dollar does move through HK$7.7500, a key support point, dealers expect a swift defense by the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the territory's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , probably in the form of selling U.S. dollars rather than through raising interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Early Monday, the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7495 per U.S. dollar, weaker than the HK$7.7493 recorded late Friday. \par \par \uc2  In the futures market, the June three-month Hibor contract was quoted at 92.85 for an underlying money market rate of 7.15%. It's traded between 92.85 and 92.90 (7.15% and 7.10%) on a volume of 450 lots. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 27-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0428GMT \par \par \uc2  1085 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4r03io2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngbli