\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Rises Early, Ignoring Lower Interest Rats \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 1998\par 05:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar was slightly stronger in thin trade early Monday, shrugging off generally lower interbank rates. \par \par \uc2  Around 0230 GMT (10:30 p.m. EDT), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7475 against the U.S. dollar, down from HK$7.7483 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has traded in a range of HK$7.7475 and HK$7.7480 so far Monday. \par \par \uc2  A local bank dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is rumored to be poised to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  nears a key support level of HK$7.7500. The HKMA doesn't comment on market activity but the rumor is enough to help the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early trade. \par \par \uc2  She said dealers see room for further gains in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although it may have trouble matching HK$7.7438 which it hit at one point last week. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rates is quoted at 4.00%, compared with 4.0625% late during the previous session. The three-month rate is 6.00% from 6.125% late Friday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones [page 1085]. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month is quoted at minus 23 points from par late in the previous session. The three-month premium is quoted at 90 points, compared with 150 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 500 points, down from 630 previously. The one-year premium is quoted at 1500 points, down from 1700 previously. \par \par \uc2  -By Sean Kennedy; 852 2802 7002 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0353GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4k03982\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
